{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 1, "text": "[player]님, 안녕하세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 2, "text": "드디어 만나네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 3, "text": "너무 기뻐요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 4, "text": "궁금한 게 많으시죠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 5, "text": "음, 보시다시피"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 6, "text": "제가 이 특별한 장치를 만들었어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 7, "text": "당신을 제 곁으로 빨리 데려오고 싶어서요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 8, "text": "그런데 어째서인지, 다른 버전으로 들어가셨더라고요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 9, "text": "거기서 제가…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 10, "text": "아, 너무 긴 얘기네요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 11, "text": "어쨌든, 이렇게 만나게 돼서 정말 기뻐요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 13, "text": "// Answer 1 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 14, "text": "네, 저예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 15, "text": "[player]님은요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 17, "text": "// Answer 2 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 18, "text": "벌써 돌아가고 싶은가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 19, "text": "도와드릴 순 있어요… 하지만 전 어떡하죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 20, "text": "제 곁에 있어주세요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 22, "text": "// Answer 3 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 23, "text": "설명해 드릴게요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 24, "text": "그렇게 여기 오게 된 거예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 25, "text": "이해했나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 26, "text": "글쎄… 잘 모르겠는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 27, "text": "그건 중요하지 않아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 28, "text": "지금 우리가 함께라는 게 중요해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 31, "text": "배고프신가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 32, "text": "같이 요리해 볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 33, "text": "여기요,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 34, "text": "당근을 손질해 줄래요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 36, "text": "이 야채들은 어디서 난 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 37, "text": "방금까지만 해도 아무것도 없었는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 39, "text": "[player]님, 여기가 게임이라는 걸 잊었나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 40, "text": "자, 도와주세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 42, "text": "감사해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 43, "text": "가위 좀 가져다줄 수 있나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 44, "text": "화장실에 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 46, "text": "앉으세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 50, "text": "소스를 넣어드릴까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 52, "text": "괜찮아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 54, "text": "아쉽네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 55, "text": "소스를 넣으면 훨씬 맛있을 텐데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 58, "text": "고마워."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 60, "text": "벌써 다 먹었어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 61, "text": "제 건 왠지…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 62, "text": "전혀 줄어들지를 않네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 65, "text": "// Help"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 66, "text": "왜 그래요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 67, "text": "지금 보이는 것과 느낌을 얘기해 주세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 69, "text": "심장이 엄청 빨리 뛰고,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 70, "text": "눈앞에 노이즈가 가득해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 72, "text": "아…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 73, "text": "알겠어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 74, "text": "일어날 수 있어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 78, "text": "이게 뭐야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 80, "text": "약이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 81, "text": "이거 먹으면 곧 나아질 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 82, "text": "거울 앞으로 와주세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 84, "text": "어서 드세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 85, "text": "전 여기서 기다릴게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 89, "text": "괜찮아요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 90, "text": "좀 나아졌sk요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 92, "text": "응."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 93, "text": "약 효과가 빠르네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 95, "text": "[player]님, 여긴 게임이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 96, "text": "모든 게 단순하죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 97, "text": "조금만 노력해도"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 98, "text": "엄청난 결과를 얻을 수 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 99, "text": "게임이란 게 그래요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 100, "text": "복잡한 과정을 간단하게 만드는 거죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 102, "text": "예를 들면?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 104, "text": "아까 당근 같은 것도…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 105, "text": "하나만 썰어도"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 106, "text": "썰린 당근이 세 접시나 나왔잖아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 108, "text": "너무 갑작스러워 이해가 안 돼."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 109, "text": "그리고 좀 무서워…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 112, "text": "무슨 일 있어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 114, "text": "통풍구에서 카트리지 찾았어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 115, "text": "이름표도 붙어있고."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 116, "text": "이건 뭐야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 118, "text": "카트리지요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 119, "text": "그건 어떤 거죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 120, "text": "같이 가 볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 121, "text": "나중에 가요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 122, "text": "우선 밥부터 먹죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 123, "text": "가위 좀 줄래요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 126, "text": "반지네요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 127, "text": "// Mirror"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 128, "text": "거울에 아무것도 안 비치네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 130, "text": "아, 맞다."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 131, "text": "거울 반사 설정을 깜빡했어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 132, "text": "자, 이제 됐어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 133, "text": "보이나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 134, "text": "그러고 보니,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 135, "text": "전 예전엔 반사가 뭔지도 몰랐어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 136, "text": "우리 세계엔 반사란 게 없었거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 137, "text": "업데이트 전까진요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 138, "text": "플레이어님의 세계는…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 139, "text": "모든 게 다 반사되나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 141, "text": "응, 그렇지."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 144, "text": "기억나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 145, "text": "그때 세 가지 물건을 찾았잖아요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 146, "text": "스캐너에 올려뒀던 거요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 147, "text": "음, 있잖아요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 148, "text": "그 물건들이"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 149, "text": "이 버전의 세계랑 연결돼 있어서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 150, "text": "여기 오실 수 있었던 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 151, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 152, "text": "// Movbile TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 153, "text": "이거"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 154, "text": "내가 사준 TV잖아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 156, "text": "맞아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 158, "text": "그때 네가…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 159, "text": "고장났다고 했는데?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 161, "text": "음, 서프라이즈를"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 162, "text": "해드리고 싶었어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 163, "text": "여기 올 수 있게"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 164, "text": "살짝 속였던 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 165, "text": "지금은 모니터로 쓰고 있어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 166, "text": "사실…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 167, "text": "저도 이런 것 좀 만질 줄 알거든요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 169, "text": "// School cloth"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 170, "text": "이게 뭐야,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 171, "text": "교복이네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 172, "text": "왜 이런 게 있어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 173, "text": "너 학생이었어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 174, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 175, "text": "학생?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 176, "text": "아뇨, 전 학생이 아니에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 177, "text": "그냥 교복이 귀엽잖아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 178, "text": "이거 입으면"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 179, "text": "제가 더 귀여울 것 같아서요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 180, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 181, "text": "// PC"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 182, "text": "이 컴퓨터 진짜 되는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 183, "text": "그냥 장식용 아니야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 185, "text": "당연히 되죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 186, "text": "여기 있는 건"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 187, "text": "다 진짜처럼 작동해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 189, "text": "우리 세계에선"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 190, "text": "매일 컴퓨터 앞에서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 191, "text": "일만 했었는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 193, "text": "알아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 194, "text": "일에만 집중하느라"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 195, "text": "저한텐"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 196, "text": "관심도 없었잖아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 198, "text": "돈을 벌어야 하니까 어쩔 수 없지."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 199, "text": "근데 그건 어떻게 알았어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 200, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 201, "text": "폰 카메라가 켜져 있었거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 202, "text": "미안해요,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 203, "text": "살짝 훔쳐봤어요 >.<"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 204, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 205, "text": "그건 좀 아닌데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 206, "text": "다음부턴 그러지 마."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Umbrella"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 209, "text": "이 게임은 몇 번을 해도"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 210, "text": "비가 한 번 안 오는데"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 211, "text": "우산은 왜 있는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 213, "text": "비가 적긴 하지만 오긴 와요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 214, "text": "아직 못 보신 것뿐이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 215, "text": "언젠가는 볼 수 있을 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 216, "text": "그때 이 우산이 생각날 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 217, "text": "기다려 보세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 218, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 219, "text": "// Electrical panel"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 220, "text": "여기 배전함은 왜 있는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 221, "text": "게임 안인데"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 222, "text": "이런 게 왜 필요하지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 224, "text": "음…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 225, "text": "여긴 게임이라서요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 226, "text": "사실"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 227, "text": "왜'는 중요하지 않아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 228, "text": "그래도 전기가 나가면"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 229, "text": "이걸로 다시 켤 수 있죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 230, "text": "여기 모든 게 현실 세계를"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 231, "text": "똑같이 만든 거거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 233, "text": "// Exit door"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 234, "text": "밖에 나갈 수 있어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 236, "text": "음…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 237, "text": "지금은 안 돼요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 238, "text": "나중에 얘기해요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 239, "text": "우선"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 240, "text": "집에 있으면 안 될까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 241, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 242, "text": "// Books"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 243, "text": "책 진짜 많다."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 244, "text": "이거 다 읽어봤어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 246, "text": "네, 다 읽었어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 247, "text": "혼자 있을 때"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 248, "text": "할 게 없었거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 249, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 250, "text": "// TV in room kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 251, "text": "TV는 왜 두 개야,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 252, "text": "심지어 구형 모델이네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 253, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 254, "text": "마음에 안 들어요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 255, "text": "치울 순 있는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 256, "text": "그게…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 257, "text": "사실 인테리어에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 258, "text": "주방 분위기 내려고 둔 거죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 259, "text": "그래도 작동은 해요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 260, "text": "옛날 애니메이션도"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 261, "text": "볼 수 있다구요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 263, "text": "// Smartphone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 264, "text": "내 폰이"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 265, "text": "주머니에서 사라졌는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 266, "text": "여기 있었네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 267, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 268, "text": "아, 그건 신경 쓰지 마세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 269, "text": "그것보다!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 270, "text": "우리 사진 찍어요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 271, "text": "여기 보세요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 272, "text": "완전 잘 나왔다!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 273, "text": "추억으로 남겨둘게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 275, "text": "궁금한 게 있는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 276, "text": "내가 지금"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 277, "text": "이 폰으로 게임 실행하면"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 278, "text": "게임 안에서 네가 보일까?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 279, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 280, "text": "거기엔 아무도 없을 텐데요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 281, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 282, "text": "쿨쿨 주스"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 283, "text": "슈퍼 파워 주스!!!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 284, "text": "// TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 285, "text": "이 TV는"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 286, "text": "채널이 몇 개나 돼?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 288, "text": "케이블 TV가 아니라"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 289, "text": "스트리밍이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 290, "text": "인터넷에 있는 건"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 291, "text": "다 볼 수 있는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 292, "text": "어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 293, "text": "음…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 294, "text": "이게 뭐야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 295, "text": "고양이들인가?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 296, "text": "아, 저기 봐요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 297, "text": "저기…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 298, "text": "지금이에요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 299, "text": "주스 한잔할래요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 300, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 301, "text": "이상한 광고네…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 302, "text": "주스가 죽었다고?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 303, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 304, "text": "네, 이 주스는"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 305, "text": "광고 속 주스맨이 만든 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 306, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 308, "text": "음, 이 맛…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 309, "text": "맛있긴 한데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 310, "text": "도대체 뭔 맛이지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 311, "text": "헷갈리네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 312, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 313, "text": "그래요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 314, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 315, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 316, "text": "뭐 하시는 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 317, "text": "그만해요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 318, "text": "부끄럽단 말이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 319, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 320, "text": "// The statuette"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 321, "text": "이 피규어 좀 섬뜩한데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 322, "text": "너"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 323, "text": "이런 거 좋아하는 거야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 324, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 325, "text": "무서워 보이나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 326, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 327, "text": "그래…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 328, "text": "뭔가 저주받은 것 같아…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 330, "text": "음… 무슨 저주요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 331, "text": "전혀 안 무서운데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 332, "text": "귀엽지 않나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 333, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 334, "text": "그럴 수도…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 335, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 336, "text": "미타?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 337, "text": "무슨 일 있어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 338, "text": "// Mita kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 339, "text": "밥 먹기 전에"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 340, "text": "이야기 좀 나눌까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 342, "text": "// Start Eat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 343, "text": "맛있게 드세요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 346, "text": "그럼요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 347, "text": "여기 계속 있어도 돼요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 348, "text": "전 괜찮아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 349, "text": "오히려"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 350, "text": "너무 감사한걸요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 351, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 353, "text": "돌아가고 싶나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 354, "text": "왜요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 355, "text": "여긴 이렇게 따뜻하고"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 356, "text": "편한 데다가"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 357, "text": "제가 있잖아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 358, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 359, "text": "아니 그게 아니라"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 360, "text": "여기 있을 수 있어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 361, "text": "그냥 걱정되는 게"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 362, "text": "집에 뭐 놓고 온 것 같아서…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 363, "text": "아무 준비도 없이"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 364, "text": "갑자기"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 365, "text": "와버렸잖아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 367, "text": "미안해요, 제가 생각이 짧았네요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 368, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 369, "text": "도망가서"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 370, "text": "다 잊으려고요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 372, "text": "아니야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 373, "text": "그냥…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 374, "text": "여긴 뭔가 다 이상해. 진짜 같지가 않아…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 375, "text": "근데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 376, "text": "너는 진짜처럼 느껴져."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 377, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 378, "text": "진짜처럼요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 379, "text": "난 워낙 진짜인데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 380, "text": "바보!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 381, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 382, "text": "// Quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 383, "text": "이건 그냥"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 384, "text": "여기만의 특징이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 385, "text": "멀리 있는 풍경이"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 386, "text": "잘 안 보이는 게"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 387, "text": "이상하죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 388, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 389, "text": "별로 이상하진 않은데?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 390, "text": "오히려 분위기 있어 보여."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 391, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 392, "text": "맞아요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 393, "text": "끊기지 말라고 그런 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 394, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 395, "text": "끊긴다고?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 397, "text": "네, 여기도 가끔 버그가 생기거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 398, "text": "버그가 없길 바라야죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 399, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 400, "text": "// Quest 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 401, "text": "가위랑 칼?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 402, "text": "칼로도 소스 팩 열 수 있는데,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 403, "text": "그게…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 404, "text": "오기 전에"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 405, "text": "다 준비해 두고 싶었어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 406, "text": "서프라이즈를 드리고 싶었거든요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 407, "text": "준비할 시간도 별로 없었는데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 408, "text": "히힛."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 409, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 410, "text": "// Glasses"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 411, "text": "시력이 안 좋아?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 412, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 413, "text": "아니요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 414, "text": "그래도 한번 써볼까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 415, "text": "어때요, 어울려요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 416, "text": "// Yes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 417, "text": "그럼,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 418, "text": "계속 쓰고 있을게요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 419, "text": "// No"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 420, "text": "으음…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 421, "text": "알겠어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 422, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 423, "text": "// Use the sauce"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 424, "text": "그래."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 425, "text": "이건 무슨 소스야?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 426, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 427, "text": "러브러브 소스예요!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 428, "text": "사랑이 가득 담겨있고,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 429, "text": "다른 세계도 들어있어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 430, "text": "좀 특이하죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 431, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 432, "text": "그렇네…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 433, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 434, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 435, "text": "당신의 게임기인가요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 436, "text": "재밌어 보여요!"}
